From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 17:31:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Show the upcoming Q and HC count on the workout detail page

The nearby cards show who has the Q and how many PAX have HC'd for the
next occurrence, but tapping through to the workout lost that. Add an
"up next" row at the top of the detail card with the date (Today,
Tomorrow, or the weekday), the Q, and the HC badge, and hide it once
the enriched date is behind us so it is never shown against the wrong day.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YT3ubrcTis7ctkWAXDLv49
---
